IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cbca-core`
IMPORT `cb1-part1-application`

-- Tests of cb1-part1-application.l4 (s 3 and s 4). Expected values are written from the text of the Act
-- (src:116-136), never from the code's output: each comment says what the text gives.

§ `Tests -- Part I application`

§§ `s 3(1)`

-- src:117: applies to every corporation incorporated, and every body corporate continued, that has not been discontinued.
#ASSERT `this Act applies to the body corporate within s 3(1)` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `this Act applies to the body corporate within s 3(1)` FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- discontinued: the Act no longer applies
#ASSERT NOT (`this Act applies to the body corporate within s 3(1)` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`this Act applies to the body corporate within s 3(1)` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- neither incorporated nor continued under this Act: not a corporation under it
#ASSERT NOT (`this Act applies to the body corporate within s 3(1)` FALSE FALSE FALSE)

§§ `s 3(3)`

-- src:122-124: the CNCA, the Winding-up and Restructuring Act, and inconsistent Special Act provisions are excluded.
#ASSERT `the law is excluded from applying to a corporation within s 3(3)` `the Canada Not-for-profit Corporations Act` FALSE
#ASSERT `the law is excluded from applying to a corporation within s 3(3)` `the Winding-up and Restructuring Act` FALSE
#ASSERT `the law is excluded from applying to a corporation within s 3(3)` `a provision of a Special Act, as defined in section 87 of the Canada Transportation Act` TRUE
-- a consistent Special Act provision is not excluded
#ASSERT NOT (`the law is excluded from applying to a corporation within s 3(3)` `a provision of a Special Act, as defined in section 87 of the Canada Transportation Act` FALSE)
-- some other law: s 3(3) does not exclude it
#ASSERT NOT (`the law is excluded from applying to a corporation within s 3(3)` `any other law` TRUE)

§§ `s 3(4) and s 3(5)`

#ASSERT `the corporation is prohibited from carrying on the business within s 3(4)` `the business of a bank`
#ASSERT `the corporation is prohibited from carrying on the business within s 3(4)` `the business of an association to which the Cooperative Credit Associations Act applies`
#ASSERT `the corporation is prohibited from carrying on the business within s 3(4)` `the business of a company or society to which the Insurance Companies Act applies`
#ASSERT `the corporation is prohibited from carrying on the business within s 3(4)` `the business of a company to which the Trust and Loan Companies Act applies`
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is prohibited from carrying on the business within s 3(4)` `any other business`)

-- src:132: a degree-granting institution only with express authorization by a federal or provincial agent.
#ASSERT `the corporation is prohibited from carrying on a degree-granting educational institution within s 3(5)` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is prohibited from carrying on a degree-granting educational institution within s 3(5)` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is prohibited from carrying on a degree-granting educational institution within s 3(5)` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is prohibited from carrying on a degree-granting educational institution within s 3(5)` FALSE TRUE)

§§ `s 4`

-- src:136: three purposes.
#ASSERT count `the purposes of this Act within s 4` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the purposes of this Act within s 4` EQUALS LIST `to revise and reform the law applicable to business corporations incorporated to carry on business throughout Canada`, `to advance the cause of uniformity of business corporation law in Canada`, `to provide a means of allowing an orderly transferance of certain federal companies incorporated under various Acts of Parliament to this Act`
